{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1154037-looking-for-old-white-wolf-website-art","id":1154037,"title":"Looking for old White Wolf website art","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-10-29T19:09:00-07:00","id":1154037,"title":"Looking for old White Wolf website art","content":"Back in the day, the White Wolf website had some profiles for major characters from most of their game lines. (Back in the day as in, the website used frames and had the cemetery gate-looking borders. Some of you will remember. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been trying to track down some of this art over the years, but I've only found one or two pieces. I seem to remember art for Werewolf and Wild West characters, as well as Wraith, Vampire, and maybe even Changeling or Mage.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know where I might find any of the rest of these, or have them stored personally? Any help would be much appreciated.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7445-viking-funeral","name":"Viking Funeral","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7445_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-29T22:29:05-07:00","id":1154060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Viking Funeral</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1154037-looking-for-old-white-wolf-website-art#post1154037\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Back in the day, the White Wolf website had some profiles for major characters from most of their game lines. (Back in the day as in, the website used frames and had the cemetery gate-looking borders. Some of you will remember. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I've been trying to track down some of this art over the years, but I've only found one or two pieces. I seem to remember art for Werewolf and Wild West characters, as well as Wraith, Vampire, and maybe even Changeling or Mage.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know where I might find any of the rest of these, or have them stored personally? Any help would be much appreciated.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Here you go: <a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/19980206090349fw_/http://www.white-wolf.com:80/Games/Pages/Sig%20Characters/Sig%20Char%20Title.html\" target=\"_blank\">https://web.archive.org/web/19980206...r%20Title.html</a>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Mage: the Ascension - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1191028-redesigned-prime-sphere\" target=\"_blank\">Redesigned Prime Sphere</a>; <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1188769-simpler-wonder-creation\" target=\"_blank\">Streamlined Wonder Creation</a><br /> Mummy: the Curse - <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/474927-mummy-the-